// Description: Shows how to produce a PDF with solid gridlines from an Excel workbook using Aspose.Cells for .NET by enabling worksheet gridlines and setting PdfSaveOptions.RenderSolidGridlines to true.
// Keywords: Aspose.Cells | PDF gridlines | RenderSolidGridlines | PdfSaveOptions | C# Excel to PDF | solid gridlines | worksheet.IsGridlinesVisible | .NET code example
// Common Searches: Aspose.Cells render solid gridlines PDF C# | PdfSaveOptions.RenderSolidGridlines example | how to keep gridlines in PDF generated by Aspose.Cells | enable gridlines when converting Excel to PDF .NET | solid gridlines in PDF using Aspose.Cells
// Developer Intent: Generate a PDF that displays solid gridlines by configuring PdfSaveOptions.RenderSolidGridlines and worksheet gridline visibility in Aspose.Cells for .NET.
